  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **gd1980-10-01.151442.DeadSetOuttakes.miller.t.flac16** (recommended): soundboard; 27 songs; 200 min; rated 2/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Audio is described as crystal clear, though the recording lacks any drum tracks [6]\n- **gd1980-10-01.144287.dead-set.healy-mix.flac2448**: soundboard; 8 songs; 69 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [3]\n- **gd1980-10-01.150795.sbd.miller.flac2496**: soundboard; 27 songs; 200 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Tracks were considered for the Dead Set album, excluding Fire On The Mountain [1]\n- Source is from 10/27/80, despite a typo in the text file [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **gd1980-10-01.151442.DeadSetOuttakes.miller.t.flac16**: transferred by All Transfers and Mastering by Charlie Miller  October 31, 2020; source: SBD > (16-track) Reel Master > Cassette [1]. Also: Upload converted from 24-bit to 16-bit at 44.1 kHz, with silence cleaned up [1]\n- **gd1980-10-01.144287.dead-set.healy-mix.flac2448**: taped by Richie & Rip; transferred by Andrew F.; source: SBD Healy's mix-down reels > Cassette [3]. Also: Dan Healy rough mixes, later edited for release on Dead Set LP and CD [3]\n- **gd1980-10-01.150795.sbd.miller.flac2496**: transferred by All Transfers and Mastering by Charlie Miller  October 31, 2020; source: SBD > (16-track) Reel Master > Cassette [2]",
